{"id":"mg3pqm6x7n05v0ffdxoyqzlyd","title":"全球拥有好“基因(gene)”的生物医药公司：十年更新版","originalTitle":"全球拥有好“基因(gene)”的生物医药公司： 十年更新版","summary":"十年后，全球生物医药产业格局已变，基因治疗、RNA药物和人工智能蛋白设计成为主流。原榜单中的多家公司已被并购或改名，如Celgene被Bristol Myers Squibb收购，ImmunoGen被AbbVie收购。此外，中国公司如BeiGene成长为全球肿瘤公司，并改名为BeOne Medicines，不再强调“基因”身份，而是强调全球协作和肿瘤战略。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=563591&do=blog&id=1561753"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-19T01:18:48.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-19T00:24:12.791Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-19T00:24:12.791Z","category":"gene-cell","tags":["论文发表","DeepMind","OpenAI","NVIDIA"],"score":36,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}